<p><strong>To get found on Google as a salon or spa in Nepal, set up and verify your Google Business Profile, fill in every detail, add real photos and services, collect reviews, and link it to an online booking page so people can book from the listing.</strong></p>
<h2>1. Claim and verify your listing</h2>
<p>Search for your business on Google and Maps. If it does not appear, create it, then verify it so you control the details.</p>
<h2>2. Use your exact name, address and phone number</h2>
<p>Use the same name, address and phone number everywhere: your profile, website and social pages. For areas where addresses are hard to describe, add a clear landmark in the description.</p>
<h2>3. Choose the right category and list services</h2>
<p>Pick the category that matches what you mostly do, such as spa, hair salon or beauty parlour. Add your main services with short descriptions.</p>
<h2>4. Add real photos</h2>
<p>Show your entrance, rooms, chairs and finished work. People choose a place they can picture themselves in.</p>
<h2>5. Ask for reviews, and reply to them</h2>
<p>Reviews help people decide. Ask clients right after a visit and reply politely to every review, including the poor ones. <a href="/features/outreach/">Outreach</a> can ask clients for reviews, available on request.</p>
<h2>6. Link a booking page</h2>
<p>A listing that only shows a phone number loses people who do not want to call. Add an online booking link, and use the same link on Instagram and WhatsApp. See <a href="/features/booking/">online booking</a>, read <a href="/blog/online-booking-system-nepal/">the online booking guide</a> and <a href="/blog/stop-taking-bookings-on-whatsapp-nepal/">why to stop taking bookings on WhatsApp</a>.</p>
<h2>7. Keep it current</h2>
<p>Update opening hours for festivals such as Dashain and Tihar. See <a href="/blog/dashain-tihar-salon-spa-bookings-nepal/">how to prepare for festival bookings</a>.</p>
<p><a href="#try-free" data-trial-open>Try the free Zennly demo</a> and get a booking link for your profile.</p>

